@startuml
title C06 Navigation cancellation
' Traces: OMCT-C06-L2-01.04

actor "Consumer" as Consumer
participant "cupola Shell" as Shell
participant "Telemetry Request Interceptor" as Interceptor
participant "@cupola/core Telemetry API" as TelemetryApi
participant "@cupola/api Telemetry Gateway" as TelemetryGateway

Consumer -> TelemetryApi: request(object, options)
activate TelemetryApi
TelemetryApi -> Interceptor: attach cancellation to active path
activate Interceptor
Interceptor --> TelemetryApi: cancellable request options
deactivate Interceptor
TelemetryApi -> TelemetryGateway: GET /api/telemetry/{id}
activate TelemetryGateway

Shell -> Interceptor: active path changed
activate Interceptor
Interceptor -> TelemetryGateway: signal cancellation
TelemetryGateway --> TelemetryApi: request aborted
deactivate TelemetryGateway
Interceptor --> Shell: cancellation signalled
deactivate Interceptor
TelemetryApi --> Consumer: cancellation result
deactivate TelemetryApi
@enduml
